# LINKY Frontend — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local and fill in real values before going live.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OnchainKit / Coinbase Developer Platform (CDP)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# API key for Coinbase OnchainKit. Required for:
#   • Smart Wallet / MiniKit wallet-connect modal (shows LINKY branding)
#   • Gas sponsorship (paymaster) — users pay $0 gas on USDC approval + booking
#
# How to get one:
#   1. Go to https://developer.coinbase.com → Create a project
#   2. Under API Keys, create a new key and copy it here
#   3. In the same project, enable the "Paymaster" product for Base mainnet
#      (this is what makes isSponsored transactions free for your users)
VITE_ONCHAINKIT_API_KEY=

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Paymaster (gas sponsorship)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional explicit paymaster URL. When set, this URL is passed directly to
# the <Transaction> component's capabilities.paymasterService.url prop, which
# overrides the default CDP-key-derived paymaster endpoint.
#
# Leave unset to use the default OnchainKit paymaster (derived automatically
# from VITE_ONCHAINKIT_API_KEY). Only set this if you are using a custom
# paymaster (e.g. Pimlico, Alchemy, or a self-hosted bundler).
#
# Base mainnet CDP paymaster endpoint (for reference):
#   https://api.developer.coinbase.com/rpc/v1/base/<YOUR_CDP_API_KEY>
# VITE_PAYMASTER_URL=

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WalletConnect
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# WalletConnect Project ID. When set, WalletConnect appears as a wallet option
# for buyers alongside Coinbase Wallet and injected wallets (MetaMask etc.).
# Create a project at https://cloud.walletconnect.com and paste the ID here.
# Leave blank to disable WalletConnect (Coinbase Wallet still works without it).
VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
